  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe’s blade comes down between your middle and ring finger, cleaving your hand lengthwise almost to the wrist, leaving the hand split like a grotesque lobster claw. Gruesome!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You must pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Cool</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) from the horrible sight. Fortunately the blade passed between the metacarpal bones, keeping nerves and tendons in the hand intact. The hand is useless for the rest of the encounter (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.zyocWSzEZEC826NS]{Amputated Parts}), but will count as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.qn4ZpvTQIX4rcJDl]{Torn Muscle (Major)} after the encounter when you’ve had a chance to wrap the two halves of the split hand together again with a bandage or rag.</p>"
    },
